### Applications of Stacks

Stacks are used for:
- Nesting (e.g., parentheses)
- Evaluating arithmetic expressions
- Implementing function/method calls
- Backtracking (e.g., maze solving)
- Undo sequences in text editors
- Auxiliary data structures for algorithms
- Components of other data structures

