}
}
From the example above, we can see that the two object classes TKGiaoVien and TKQTV do not need to be rebuilt from scratch but still contain all the necessary attributes and methods thanks to inheritance.
Encapsulation : Encapsulation here means packaging attributes and methods into classes, packaging classes into packages, etc., in order to hide information and ensure data integrity. Example 7:
// Định nghĩa lớp Money
public class Money{
/* Toàn bộ các thuộc tính để phạm vi truy cập là private, điều này có nghĩa là
